+
+GitHub search (repo `Supremeai-bd/supremeai-open`, checked 2026-10-30 ~06:10Z): `wizard keyboard` → 0 hits; `accessibility onboarding` → 0 hits. Prior own filings (#2594 chip keyboard, #2736/#2912 degraded viewer) cover different surfaces.
